      {
        "Id": "a84a73f8ccdc4071a96106860c60bc6d",
        "Title": "What this does: Makes a structural plan view for every Level in the model.\n\nBefore you run: Make sure the arch levels have been copy/monitored into this project first. Check the Watch box to see which Levels will get views.\n\nWarning: This makes a view for every Level, including parapet and T.O. Steel levels. Delete any you don't want afterwards. Running it twice will error on Levels that already have a view.",
